Version 2.4.3 has no changes to the actual plugin, but adds support
for AU plugins (including presets) to the MacOS installation bundle.
The new version number is just to differentiate from the previous
VST3-only bundle.

Limitation:
- The DPF framework used does currently not support resizing AU
  plugins by dragging the window borders. Instead, use the UI Scale
  parameter in the UI menu of the MiMi-d plugin itself.

Because of the MacOS-only nature of this release, no Zynthian version
has been created nor tagged.
